P19-CONT-001 mutation probes, run against the repaired tree

Driver: docs/verification/P19-CONT-001/experiments/probe.cmd + subst.py.
Each probe replaces ONE piece of text in CfdContinuity.cpp or .hpp, rebuilds
debug-ext, runs the continuity suite, reverts, and re-hashes both files. The run
stops dead if a revert does not restore a file exactly.

  KILLED    the suite failed -- what a behavioural probe must do
  COMPILER  rejected at compile time -- STRONGER than a test kill
  SURVIVED  the suite passed -- correct ONLY for a documented-unreachable
            guard and for the no-op control

