------------------------------------------------------------------------------
M26 WAS INCONCLUSIVE AS WRITTEN AND IS NOT COUNTED. Disabling the cell-volume
guard with `if (false)` leaves `cell` unused, and `-Wunused-variable` inside
`-Werror` rejects the translation unit -- so the probe never ran and said
nothing about reachability. Re-run in a form that still USES `cell`:
`volume > 0.0` becomes `volume >= 0.0`, which can never fire for a geometry that
describes the topology, so it is the same disabling expressed legally.

BASELINE All tests passed (7435 assertions in 49 test cases)
SURVIVE SURVIVED M26b the cell volume guard, disabled as >= 0.0 (UNREACHABLE)
FINAL All tests passed (7435 assertions in 49 test cases)
FINAL both files MATCH pristine

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TOTALS

  behavioural probes caught     22 of 22   (19 by tests, 3 by the compiler)
  unreachable guards survived    5 of 5    (M23, M24, M25, M26b, M27)
  no-op control                 SURVIVED   as a control must
  reverts verified by hash      every probe; both files match pristine

THE THREE COMPILER KILLS ARE STRONGER THAN TEST KILLS, and two of them exist
only because of the hygiene pass:

  M15  swapping the direction test gives `if (phi < 0.0) ... else if (phi < 0.0)`
       and -Wduplicated-cond rejects it
  M21  the four literal-vs-literal CHECKs that a review called "assertions about
  M22  nothing" were moved into the static_asserts' own failure messages, so a
       tolerance tightened below its measurement now breaks the BUILD rather
       than a test

THE NO-OP CONTROL IS WHY THIS TABLE CAN BE READ AT ALL. Three earlier harnesses
reported "rejected by the compiler" for every probe INCLUDING the control, which
is impossible for a reorder of two independent assignments. Each time the cause
was environmental rather than a code change -- an MSYS2 PATH making MSYS2 a
find_package prefix candidate, then a POSIX-converted LOCALAPPDATA producing a
prefix Windows could not resolve. A probe table without a control would have
looked like strong evidence on all three occasions.
